            "properties": {},
            "widgets_values": [
              "## H3 Continuum EZ Studio\n\nモデルをサブグラフで選び、Studioの「共通参照」に自分の素材を追加します。\nSelect the models on the subgraph, then add your images under Shared References in Studio.\n\n- [H3 REF2VA](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors) → `models/diffusion_models/`\n- [H3 text encoder](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors) → `models/text_encoders/`\n- [P-H3 prompt upsampler](https://huggingface.co/PrunaAI/p-h3-image-comfy/resolve/main/text_encoders/p-h3-image_prompt_upsampler_w4a8.safetensors) → `models/text_encoders/`\n- [Video VAE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors) → `models/vae/`\n- [Pika Flex REF2VA LoRA](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/loras/pika_h3_flex_ref2va_v1_bf16.safetensors) → `models/loras/`\n- [Audio VAE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors) → `models/vae/`\n\n[日本語ガイド](https://github.com/ukr8b3g-cmyk/ComfyUI-H3-Continuum-EZ/blob/main/README_JA.md) · [English guide](https://github.com/ukr8b3g-cmyk/ComfyUI-H3-Continuum-EZ/blob/main/README.md)"
            ],
            "widgets_values_named": {
              "text": "## H3 Continuum EZ Studio\n\nモデルをサブグラフで選び、Studioの「共通参照」に自分の素材を追加します。\nSelect the models on the subgraph, then add your images under Shared References in Studio.\n\n- [H3 REF2VA](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors) → `models/diffusion_models/`\n- [H3 text encoder](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors) → `models/text_encoders/`\n- [P-H3 prompt upsampler](https://huggingface.co/PrunaAI/p-h3-image-comfy/resolve/main/text_encoders/p-h3-image_prompt_upsampler_w4a8.safetensors) → `models/text_encoders/`\n- [Video VAE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors) → `models/vae/`\n- [Pika Flex REF2VA LoRA](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/loras/pika_h3_flex_ref2va_v1_bf16.safetensors) → `models/loras/`\n- [Audio VAE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors) → `models/vae/`\n\n[日本語ガイド](https://github.com/ukr8b3g-cmyk/ComfyUI-H3-Continuum-EZ/blob/main/README_JA.md) · [English guide](https://github.com/ukr8b3g-cmyk/ComfyUI-H3-Continuum-EZ/blob/main/README.md)"
